  "instructions": [
    "preheat the oven to 400 degrees fahrenheit.",
    "season the chicken thighs with salt and pepper.",
    "heat the olive oil in the terracotta dish over medium heat.",
    "sauté the onion, garlic, and ginger until softened.",
    "add the ancho chili powder, cumin, coriander, and herbes-de-provence. cook for 1 minute.",
    "add the chicken thighs and cook until browned on all sides.",
    "transfer the terracotta dish to the preheated oven.",
    "bake for 25 minutes or until the chicken is cooked through.",
    "remove the dish from the oven and top with crumbled feta cheese.",
    "return the dish to the oven and bake for an additional 5 minutes or until the cheese is melted and bubbly.",
    "garnish with chopped fresh parsley.",
    "serve hot."
